{"seq":3,"slug":"non-chord-tones","title":"非和弦音与装饰技法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/non-chord-tones","wordCount":1562,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"非和弦音与装饰技法\">非和弦音与装饰技法</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>非和弦音（NCT）是不属于当前和弦的音，它们在旋律中承担装饰、填充与过渡。理解它们的统一原则是&quot;出发-偏离-回归&quot;：非和弦音必须以规则方式离开和弦音并回到和弦音（或进入下一个和弦音），其类型由三个维度唯一确定——进入方式（级进/跳进/保持）、离开方式（级进/跳进/保持）与节拍位置（强拍/弱拍）。延留音与倚音因落在强拍而张力最强，因而最具表现力。后文七种类型、经过/辅助音、延留/倚音与踏板音都由此展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"非和弦音的概念\">非和弦音的概念</h2><p>非和弦音（Non-Chord Tones, NCT）是不属于当前和弦成员的音，它们在旋律中起着装饰、填充与过渡的作用。如果说和弦音是建筑的承重结构，非和弦音就是连接各房间的走廊与装饰——它们让音乐从骨架变为有血有肉的有机体。</p>\n<p>非和弦音的存在遵循一个核心原则：<strong>它们必须以规则的方式离开和弦音并回到和弦音</strong>（或进入下一个和弦音）。这种&quot;出发-偏离-回归&quot;的模式赋予了旋律以运动感与表现力。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;和弦音&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;非和弦音&lt;br/&gt;(装饰/过渡)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;和弦音&lt;br/&gt;(解决)&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;直接到下一&lt;br/&gt;和弦音&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"和弦音\"] --&gt; B[\"非和弦音&lt;br/&gt;(装饰/过渡)\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"和弦音&lt;br/&gt;(解决)\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"直接到下一&lt;br/&gt;和弦音\"]</pre><h2 id=\"七种基本非和弦音类型\">七种基本非和弦音类型</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>进入方式</th>\n<th>离开方式</th>\n<th>节拍位置</th>\n<th>示例（C和弦中）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>经过音 (PT)</td>\n<td>级进</td>\n<td>同向级进</td>\n<td>弱拍</td>\n<td>C→<strong>D</strong>→E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>辅助音 (NT)</td>\n<td>级进</td>\n<td>反向回原音</td>\n<td>弱拍</td>\n<td>E→<strong>F</strong>→E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延留音 (SUS)</td>\n<td>保持</td>\n<td>级进下行</td>\n<td>强拍</td>\n<td>(前和弦F)→<strong>F</strong>→E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>先现音 (ANT)</td>\n<td>级进</td>\n<td>保持到新和弦</td>\n<td>弱拍</td>\n<td>E→<strong>D</strong>→(新和弦D)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>倚音 (APP)</td>\n<td>跳进</td>\n<td>级进</td>\n<td>强拍</td>\n<td>跳到<strong>F</strong>→E</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>逃逸音 (ET)</td>\n<td>级进</td>\n<td>跳离</td>\n<td>弱拍</td>\n<td>E→<strong>F</strong>→跳C</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>踏板音 (PED)</td>\n<td>保持</td>\n<td>保持</td>\n<td>任意</td>\n<td>持续C不动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"经过音与辅助音\">经过音与辅助音</h2><p><strong>经过音</strong>（Passing Tone）是最常见的非和弦音。它填充两个和弦音之间的空隙，以级进方式连接两个不同音高的和弦音：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>上行经过：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><munder><munder><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>PT</mtext></munder><mo>→</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{上行经过：} C \\to \\underbrace{D}_{\\text{PT}} \\to E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上行经过：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PT</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>下行经过：</mtext><mi>G</mi><mo>→</mo><munder><munder><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>PT</mtext></munder><mo>→</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{下行经过：} G \\to \\underbrace{F}_{\\text{PT}} \\to E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">下行经过：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">G</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">PT</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>经过音也可以是半音化的：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>半音经过：</mtext><mi>C</mi><mo>→</mo><munder><munder><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">♯</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>CPT</mtext></munder><mo>→</mo><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{半音经过：} C \\to \\underbrace{C\\sharp}_{\\text{CPT}} \\to D</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">半音经过：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2152em;vertical-align:-1.5208em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.4792em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CPT</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.1576em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\">♯</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8424em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5208em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>辅助音</strong>（Neighbor Tone）从和弦音出发，级进到相邻的非和弦音，再返回原音：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>上辅助：</mtext><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo><munder><munder><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>UN</mtext></munder><mo>→</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{上辅助：} E \\to \\underbrace{F}_{\\text{UN}} \\to E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上辅助：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">UN</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>下辅助：</mtext><mi>E</mi><mo>→</mo><munder><munder><mi>D</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>LN</mtext></munder><mo>→</mo><mi>E</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{下辅助：} E \\to \\underbrace{D}_{\\text{LN}} \\to E</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">下辅助：</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0097em;vertical-align:-1.3263em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.6737em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">LN</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.352em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.648em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3263em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    subgraph 经过音与辅助音对比&#10;        A[&quot;经过音&lt;br/&gt;连接两个不同和弦音&lt;br/&gt;A → B → C&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;辅助音&lt;br/&gt;装饰同一和弦音&lt;br/&gt;A → B → A&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart TD\n    subgraph 经过音与辅助音对比\n        A[\"经过音&lt;br/&gt;连接两个不同和弦音&lt;br/&gt;A → B → C\"]\n        B[\"辅助音&lt;br/&gt;装饰同一和弦音&lt;br/&gt;A → B → A\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"延留音与倚音\">延留音与倚音</h2><p><strong>延留音</strong>（Suspension）是功能和声中最具表现力的非和弦音。它由三个阶段构成：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>预备</strong>（Preparation）：在前一个和弦中作为和弦音出现</li>\n<li><strong>延留</strong>（Suspension）：当和弦变化时，该音保持不动，成为新和弦的非和弦音，落在<strong>强拍</strong></li>\n<li><strong>解决</strong>（Resolution）：下行级进到新和弦的和弦音</li>\n</ol>\n<p>延留音的命名方式是两个数字——延留音到低音的音程和解决音到低音的音程：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mtext> 延留：四度延留解决到三度</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4-3 \\text{ 延留：} \\text{四度延留解决到三度}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">延留：</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">四度延留解决到三度</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mtext> 延留：七度延留解决到六度</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7-6 \\text{ 延留：} \\text{七度延留解决到六度}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">延留：</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">七度延留解决到六度</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mtext> 延留：九度延留解决到八度</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">9-8 \\text{ 延留：} \\text{九度延留解决到八度}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">延留：</span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">九度延留解决到八度</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><strong>倚音</strong>（Appoggiatura）与延留音相似（都在强拍制造不协和），但进入方式不同——倚音<strong>跳入</strong>而非保持：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>延留音：保持 → 不协和 → 解决</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{延留音：保持 → 不协和 → 解决}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">延留音：保持</span><span class=\"mord\"> → </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不协和</span><span class=\"mord\"> → </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">解决</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>倚音：跳入 → 不协和 → 解决</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{倚音：跳入 → 不协和 → 解决}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">倚音：跳入</span><span class=\"mord\"> → </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不协和</span><span class=\"mord\"> → </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">解决</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>特征</th>\n<th>延留音</th>\n<th>倚音</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>进入方式</td>\n<td>保持（tie）</td>\n<td>跳进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>节拍位置</td>\n<td>强拍</td>\n<td>强拍</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解决方向</td>\n<td>下行级进</td>\n<td>上行或下行级进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>需要预备</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>张力程度</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"踏板音\">踏板音</h2><p>踏板音（Pedal Point/Pedal Tone）是在和弦变化过程中保持不动的持续音。它得名于管风琴的脚键盘（Pedal）——演奏者脚踩住一个长音不放，手部在上方做各种和弦变化。</p>\n<p>踏板音最常出现在低音声部（Bass Pedal），通常是主音或属音：</p>\n<p><strong>主音踏板</strong>：在乐曲结尾制造稳定感——无论上方和声如何变化，持续的主音低音传达着&quot;一切都在掌控之中&quot;。</p>\n<p><strong>属音踏板</strong>：在再现部之前制造期待感——持续的属音累积紧张度，为主题回归做准备。</p>\n<p>踏板音也可以出现在高声部（Inverted Pedal），在浪漫派与影视配乐中常见——高音持续音制造&quot;悬浮&quot;或&quot;天堂般&quot;的效果。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 踏板音类型&#10;        A[&quot;低音踏板&lt;br/&gt;(最常见)&lt;br/&gt;稳定/期待&quot;]&#10;        B[&quot;高音踏板&lt;br/&gt;(倒置)&lt;br/&gt;悬浮/梦幻&quot;]&#10;        C[&quot;内声部踏板&lt;br/&gt;(较少见)&lt;br/&gt;色彩连接&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 踏板音类型\n        A[\"低音踏板&lt;br/&gt;(最常见)&lt;br/&gt;稳定/期待\"]\n        B[\"高音踏板&lt;br/&gt;(倒置)&lt;br/&gt;悬浮/梦幻\"]\n        C[\"内声部踏板&lt;br/&gt;(较少见)&lt;br/&gt;色彩连接\"]\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"非和弦音在流行音乐旋律中的应用\">非和弦音在流行音乐旋律中的应用</h2><p>在流行音乐旋律写作中，非和弦音的使用频率与类型选择直接影响旋律的&quot;味道&quot;：</p>\n<p><strong>经过音密集</strong> = 流畅、歌唱性强（如 Adele 的旋律风格）</p>\n<p><strong>倚音频繁</strong> = 情感强烈、戏剧性（如 Whitney Houston 的演唱装饰）</p>\n<p><strong>延留效果</strong> = 现代感、冷静（如 Billie Eilish 人声与和弦的错位关系）</p>\n<p>在 EDM 制作中，合成器主旋律（lead）大量使用经过音与辅助音填充和弦音之间的空隙，使机械的 MIDI 编程听起来更接近人声演唱的自然流动感。2025 年的 AI 旋律生成模型在非和弦音的使用合理性上已接近专业作曲水平。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>非和弦音遵循&quot;出发-偏离-回归&quot;原则，以规则方式离开并回到和弦音。</li>\n<li>七种基本类型：经过音、辅助音、延留音、先现音、倚音、逃逸音、踏板音。</li>\n<li>类型由进入方式、离开方式、节拍位置三要素确定。</li>\n<li>延留音三段式（预备-延留-解决），倚音跳入、无需预备。</li>\n<li>踏板音是在和声变化中保持不动的持续音，分低音/高音/内声部。</li>\n<li>流行旋律的&quot;味道&quot;取决于 NCT 类型选择；EDM lead 大量用经过/辅助音填充。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读与跨学科链接\">延伸阅读与跨学科链接</h2><ul>\n<li>非和弦音定义为&quot;不属于当前和弦的音&quot;，先明确何为和弦音：<a href=\"../chord-construction/triads\">三和弦的构成与分类</a></li>\n<li>延留音、倚音的强拍不协和与解决属于声部连接技术：<a href=\"voice-leading-principles\">声部连接原则</a></li>\n<li>第二/三种对位中的经过音、辅助音规则承接本节装饰技法：<a href=\"parallel-prohibition\">平行运动禁忌与对位基础</a></li>\n<li>合成器 lead 用非和弦音填充时，音色由振荡器波形决定，见合成基础：<a href=\"../../synthesizer-principles/oscillators-filters/oscillator-waveforms\">振荡器波形</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"非和弦音与装饰技法","id":"非和弦音与装饰技法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"非和弦音的概念","id":"非和弦音的概念"},{"level":2,"text":"七种基本非和弦音类型","id":"七种基本非和弦音类型"},{"level":2,"text":"经过音与辅助音","id":"经过音与辅助音"},{"level":2,"text":"延留音与倚音","id":"延留音与倚音"},{"level":2,"text":"踏板音","id":"踏板音"},{"level":2,"text":"非和弦音在流行音乐旋律中的应用","id":"非和弦音在流行音乐旋律中的应用"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接","id":"延伸阅读与跨学科链接"}],"prev":{"title":"平行运动禁忌与对位基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/voice-leading/parallel-prohibition"},"next":{"title":"爵士和声体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/music-audio/harmony-study/modern-harmony/jazz-harmony"}}